Composite: When I check that the page is correct
When I wait until element located by `caseSensitiveText(Swag Labs)` appears
Then `${current-page-url}` is equal to `https://www.saucedemo.com/`

Composite: When I fill $username, $password
When I enter `<username>` in field located by `xpath(//input[@id="user-name"])`
And I enter `<password>` in field located by `xpath(//input[@id="password"])`
And I click on element located by `xpath(//input[@id="login-button"])`
